# EAS Build upload ignore. Without this file, EAS falls back to .gitignore,
# which does NOT list the native folders — so the large regenerated native
# artifacts below get swept into the upload archive (~1.2 GB, ~18 min upload).
# Everything here is recreated on the EAS build server (npm install, pod
# install, gradle), so it never needs uploading.
#
# NOTE: a present .easignore fully REPLACES .gitignore for EAS, so the
# .gitignore excludes are repeated here.

# --- from .gitignore ---
node_modules/
.expo/
dist/
web-build/
*.tgz
.env

# --- native build artifacts (regenerated on the build server) ---
ios/Pods/
ios/build/
ios/DerivedData/
ios/.xcode.env.local
android/.gradle/
android/build/
android/app/build/
android/app/.cxx/
android/.cxx/

# --- misc local cruft ---
*.log
.DS_Store
